<p>Curse the earth around you in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns. Any who stand upon it are weakened, reducing the damage they inflict by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">22%, 31%, 38%, 45%, 50%</acronym></p>